Śatrughna enters hut same night Sītā bears twins --- Pupils report Sītā delivery and seek protective rite --- Vālmīki joyfully makes demon-destroying protection --- Vālmīki names elder Kuśa with consecrated kuśa grass --- Vālmīki names younger Lava with lava substance --- Pupils perform protection chanting Rāma lineage and birth --- Śatrughna hears midnight rejoicing and cries luck --- Śatrughna worships sage at dawn and marches west --- Śatrughna reaches Yamunā sages āśrama after seven nights